WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.993 --> 00:00:03.316
<v Speaker A>I believe that this nation should commit itself</v>

2
00:00:03.316 --> 00:00:04.951
<v Speaker A>to achieving the goal</v>

3
00:00:06.024 --> 00:00:07.466
<v Speaker A>before this decade is out</v>

4
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.966
<v Speaker A>of landing a man on the moon and</v>

5
00:00:09.966 --> 00:00:11.857
<v Speaker A>returning him safely to the Earth.</v>

6
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.821
<v Speaker B>We choose to go to the moon in</v>

7
00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:16.664
<v Speaker B>this decade and do the other things,</v>

8
00:00:17.256 --> 00:00:18.907
<v Speaker B>not because they are easy,</v>

9
00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:20.509
<v Speaker B>but because they are hard.</v>

10
00:00:21.262 --> 00:00:22.272
<v Speaker B>Because that goal</v>

11
00:00:23.329 --> 00:00:26.005
<v Speaker B>will serve to organize and measure the best</v>

12
00:00:26.694 --> 00:00:27.960
<v Speaker B>of our energies and skills.</v>

